# identity-service-helper - fakes GET /users/{id}/profile.
# Needs x-api-key: {{ishApiKey}} and a non-empty x-correlation-id.
#
# {id} is the OIDC sub. The fixture users mirror real Defra CI (cpdev) test accounts,
# so the *Sub env vars are those accounts' subs, matching data/fixtures/users.json.

### Profile - Oakfield Farmer (1 holding: 22/001/0001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity-service-helper/users/{{oakfieldSub}}/profile
x-api-key: {{ishApiKey}}
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

### Profile - Fairfield Farmer (6 holdings: 22/002/0002 .. 22/007/0007)
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity-service-helper/users/{{fairfieldSub}}/profile
x-api-key: {{ishApiKey}}
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

### Profile - Test Farmer (no holdings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity-service-helper/users/{{testFarmerSub}}/profile
x-api-key: {{ishApiKey}}
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

### Profile - unknown sub (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity-service-helper/users/not-a-real-sub/profile
x-api-key: {{ishApiKey}}
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

### Missing x-api-key (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity-service-helper/users/{{oakfieldSub}}/profile
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

### Missing x-correlation-id (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity-service-helper/users/{{oakfieldSub}}/profile
x-api-key: {{ishApiKey}}
